{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1204562-timing-for-marvels-with-pantheon-motifs","id":1204562,"title":"Timing for Marvels with pantheon motifs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-08T08:33:08-07:00","id":1204562,"title":"Timing for Marvels with pantheon motifs","content":"Does motif mean that some Pantheons need to prepare marvels ahead of time but others are instant?<br /> <br /> If my character is Teotl, do I need to spend a scene preparing a sacrifice to use Fire, but an Aesir only needs to inscribe the Kenaz rune on his sword to make a Fire Enhancement?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23791-ashnak","name":"Ashnak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-08T09:34:54-07:00","id":1204588,"title":"","content":"If you're sacrificing in a hurry, it's probably going to be food, or flowers, or your own blood. That's all stuff you can prepare for and carry with you. <br /> <br /> Marvels are a simple action - The motif doesn't change that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2649-tarion","name":"Tarion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-08T12:27:07-07:00","id":1204646,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the example Teotl marvel is someone crushing a handful of roses. It's about symbolic sacrifice, not rituals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13628-terrorforge","name":"Terrorforge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"185"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-08T12:56:52-07:00","id":1204656,"title":"","content":"With some motifs that seem like they'd take a while, like bargaining with a Kami, I would figure that you can rush it. The Kami will probably consider this impolite, but if I was the Storyteller at the time I'd assume it grasps the gravity of the situation and helps anyway, though it expects proper propitiation later. For others, like rootwork for the Orisa Scions, it can be assumed that you had the required brew on hand. You probably expected to get into fast-paced daring-do, so you came prepared, or at least have the ingredients on hand to throw something together quickly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12689-creepyshutin","name":"CreepyShutIn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-09T18:21:19-07:00","id":1205034,"title":"","content":"When also else fails and you can't find a coherent explanation for doing it quickly when it seems it would take longer, it might be viable in some cases to have them take a bit more time and compensate in some way. Giving Momentum seems like a good choice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-